  Game.Cli/        commands and tests
docs/design.md     the full design</pre>
                <h3>Useful commands</h3>
                <pre class="tree">dotnet run --project src/Game.Cli -- status      # the running lab
dotnet run --project src/Game.Cli -- history     # your progress per wave
